Z||000000||GoCartGuy||04-18-2001||11:46 PM||||Ok I was driving the GoCart to work today and thoroughly loving the new interior and I noticed two odd noises.<P>First is a ticking sound that seems to be coming from behind the ECM.  I was thinking cracked manifold but it was a little too late to check it out.<P>Second is a squeal during gradual acceleration.  I don't notice it during a good hard acceleration but then again the engine noise might drown it out.  It reminds me of what a loose timing belt sounds like.<P>Since you'll ask: 85 GT V6 Automatic, straight pipe instead of cat<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT "The GoCart"||||reg||5
